                <pb facs="0243" n="123" sameAs="frus:frus1931v02/pg123"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.51/3542: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Schoenfeld</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-10-20T11:00:00-04:40">October 20, 1931—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 11:21 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>80. Acting Receiver General informs me that he had available this morning for
                    remittance to fiscal agents New York today $160,506.31 to be distributed as
                    follows: interest on all bonds $83,790.20, amortization <pb facs="0244" n="124"
                        xml:id="pg124"/> on 1922 bonds $70, 138.88, amortization on 1926 bonds
                    $6,577.23, representing a deficit on amortization of 1926 bonds amounting to
                    $77,589.43.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schoenfeld</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
